	"YangsThoughts": "With the Trinity Alliance's development of the Heavy and Light Plasma Rifles, the allied governments of the Alliance began distributing them to their military-industrial complexes. The Magistracy of Canopus ended up with the lion's share of the Light Plasma Rifles and put them on a series of refit designs meant to showcase the new weapon's potental. Among those designs was the Fer-de-Lance FDL-7MC. This spin on the quintessentially Canopian design features the same Iron Laser as the FDL-6E but mixes up the secondary weapons with a pair each of Light Plasma Rifles and Machine Guns. The LPRs are fed by one ton of ammo and the MGs by a mere half-ton of bullets, though that is likely more than sufficient for their needs. The -7MC was a popular ride with Canopian MechWarriors and saw distribution to the elite Canopian regiments."
